    "body": "Sorry for neglecting this for so long. I took the liberty of rebasing and trying to finish it up. @annevk can you review?\r\n\r\nThis will require a few followups:\r\n\r\n- This makes certain event definitions (error, message, close) no longer apply to WebSocket, since it is not HTML's place to define events for WebSocket. The WebSocket standard will need to redefine them in its own context. I can work on a PR for that.\r\n- This removes the multipage/web-sockets.html filename. We should set up a redirect. I can work on a PR for that.",
